    "name": "Amazon Security Lake Data Lakes Subscribers API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Amazon Security Lake is a service that automatically centralizes an organization's security data from cloud, on-premises, and custom sources into a purpose-built data lake stored in your own Amazon S3. It manages the data lifecycle and supports OCSF (Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework) for normalized security data analysis.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amazon Web Services",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
